{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Before the DispersionStorm consumes the city... become a high-speed 'Rider' and race against the apocalypse to save Ebuda and become a hero.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195730/extras/31db5069ef7ea788d4fc30f15c3d25b2.poster.avif?t=1766066103\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195730/extras/31db5069ef7ea788d4fc30f15c3d25b2.webm?t=1766066103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195730/extras/31db5069ef7ea788d4fc30f15c3d25b2.mp4?t=1766066103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195730/extras/768ae6cc2c381d729f2767894576ad30.avif?t=1766066103\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Parkour \uff38 Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By combining traditional three-lane parkour mechanics with rival factions, blocking, combos, wall running, and finishing moves, we've created a completely new combat x parkour experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195730/extras/40757af022a06039c7e0243fea8a36bf.avif?t=1766066103\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195730/extras/c4d4962f5093cacd47664f5adf841134.avif?t=1766066103\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Production and development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future updates will introduce farming and cooking systems, allowing players to grow their own ingredients and prepare meals that provide powerful buffs. Combat, gathering, and crafting will form a tight gameplay loop, offering a deeper and more engaging pace of exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195730/extras/7a18fcd5d8e05f6e43d9494c4dc5a3cf.avif?t=1766066103\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Visual and Music</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A metropolis where nature and skyscrapers blend in perfect harmony. In this beautiful yet treacherous city, players can roam freely. A variety of unique maps await your exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195730/extras/d65e28bd17cd5c5c88b99d8c4276b43a.avif?t=1766066103\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\uff2a\uff2f\uff29\uff2e\u3000\uff35\uff33\uff01</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re hard at work fine-tuning the controls and rhythm of DispersionStorm, and we truly believe that player feedback is what drives us forward. Calling all Riders! Join our Discord community\u2014we prioritize our updates based on your playtesting feedback to make the game the best it can be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195730/extras/d345737fcfa9e1616f97359700bf321e.avif?t=1766066103\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195730/extras_big/d345737fcfa9e1616f97359700bf321e.avif?t=1766066103 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2195730?t=1766066103","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195730/8da47b28d03e4c2197a458ecd5ac651d2ce40741/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766066103","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195730/65faea2915bf895e78abea9f58157824fc4e558d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766066103","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195730/65faea2915bf895e78abea9f58157824fc4e558d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766066103","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Before the DispersionStorm consumes the city... become a high-speed 'Rider' and race against the apocalypse to save Ebuda and become a hero.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195730/extras/31db5069ef7ea788d4fc30f15c3d25b2.poster.avif?t=1766066103\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195730/extras/31db5069ef7ea788d4fc30f15c3d25b2.webm?t=1766066103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195730/extras/31db5069ef7ea788d4fc30f15c3d25b2.mp4?t=1766066103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195730/extras/768ae6cc2c381d729f2767894576ad30.avif?t=1766066103\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Parkour \uf