/ss_662c44e9199c1c3061da7c9711495083e3bec954.600x338.jpg?t=1766066103"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195730/47a2990a3b5989f613845607bfab3e2e9e1d5542/ss_47a2990a3b5989f613845607bfab3e2e9e1d5542.1920x1080.jpg?t=1766066103","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195730/47a2990a3b5989f613845607bfab3e2e9e1d5542/ss_47a2990a3b5989f613845607bfab3e2e9e1d5542.600x338.jpg?t=1766066103"}],"short_description":"As the sky consumed by the 'DispersionStorm' how far can you run\u2014and how many can you save\u2014before everything vanishes? DispersionStorm delivers parkour action and combat. Every leap you take shapes the very fate of the city.","steam_appid":2195730,"support_info":{"email":"tito20190909@gmail.com","url":"https://www.facebook.com/gaming/DispersionStorm"},"supported_languages":"Traditional Chinese, English, Japanese, Korean","type":"game","website":"https://www.facebook.com/gaming/DispersionStorm"}